OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill see rain clearing away south then
OL,7,Fdrier weather with fewer showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping in the early hours. Fresh
OL,9,Fnorth or northeasterly winds, strong
OL,10,Fat times across the North coast.
OL,11,FMinimum Temperature 4C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA mainly dry day, the odd
OL,14,Fshower in the north and east at first.
OL,15,FCloud breaking to allow a few sunny
OL,16,Fintervals by afternoon but turning
OL,17,Fchillier in the afternoon. Maximum
OL,18,FTemperature 7C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
